@startuml
title Chat-edited PDF backend
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Browser
component "Go server\nREST / MCP / WebSocket" as Go
component "Rust chat\nmodel and tool loop" as Rust
component "Python Doc runner\nstaged SVG assets" as Python
interface "Storage Driver" as Driver
database "DriverFS\nrepo tmp/" as FS
database "Postgres\noptional chat history" as DB
cloud "LLM endpoint" as LLM

Browser --> Go : REST + WebSocket
Browser --> Rust : JSON chat
Rust --> Go : MCP Streamable HTTP
Rust --> LLM : chat completions
Rust --> DB : chat messages
Go --> Driver : project/template keys
Driver --> FS
Go --> Python : subprocess render

note bottom of FS
  templates/{id}/template.json
  pdf/{id}/project.json
  pdf/{id}/{asset}.svg
  pdf/{id}/versions/{n}/script.py
  pdf/{id}/versions/{n}/manifest.json
  pdf/{id}/versions/{n}/pdf_render.pdf
  pdf/{id}/versions/{n}/assets/{asset}.svg
end note
@enduml
